-{x}^{2})\\cdot {3}^{2-5x} & <0 \\\\ x(9-x)\\cdot {3}^{2-5x} & <0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we divide both sides by ${3}^{2-5x}$ and get\n\n$$\nx(9-x)<0.\n$$\n\nThis represents a downwards parabola whose roots are at $x=0$ and $x=9.$ The parabola is below the $x$-axis when  $x<0$ or $x>9.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14042952/assets/1c9e8e25c57c88476bedceea237fe78eb2a28d48008493f8609ac31d9aeda30b.png)\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x<0$ or $x>9.$" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318269 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318270 13194139534898 true] [17592186318269 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534898 true] [17592186318269 1041 "field-1" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318269 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318270 13194139534898 true] [17592186318269 1110 #uuid "eec897bc-67b7-5b8e-bfca-ce067a39f540" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318270 1034 "0" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318270 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534898 true] [17592186318270 1111 #uuid "6d074725-e5d2-56de-a72e-5f6f2d06c191" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318271 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318272 13194139534898 true] [17592186318271 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534898 true] [17592186318271 1041 "field-2" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318271 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318272 13194139534898 true] [17592186318271 1110 #uuid "e352c3cf-02a8-547d-9a3b-754494635773" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318272 1034 ">" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318272 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534898 true] [17592186318272 1111 #uuid "00631d59-46c3-5009-b394-b36eb4bb57ad" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318274 13194139534898 true] [17592186318273 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534898 true] [17592186318273 1041 "field-3" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318273 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318274 13194139534898 true] [17592186318273 1110 #uuid "b1581a0a-a9f1-5b38-9b54-e72664da6d3e" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318274 1034 "9" 13194139534898 true] [17592186318274 11